  abstract = {Unlock new career horizons. Master Scrum and Agile project management for roles such as scrum master, product owner, Agile coach, and more with practical insights. Learn hands-on Scrum implementation, adapting principles to real projects, fostering effective problem-solving. Understand the difference between Agile Scrum project management and traditional project management. Be well-versed in the Scrum culture, proficient in managing projects using Scrum methodologies. This course provides a comprehensive journey into Scrum and Agile project management, starting with foundational principles and progressing to advanced concepts. Learn to orchestrate Scrum Teams, run projects with Scrum, and understand key Scrum concepts. Explore Scrum Events, essential tools like Jira, Microsoft Teams, Microsoft Planner, Trello, and integrations like ChatGPT. Includes video lectures, handouts, quizzes, and real-world applications. Ideal for beginners and professionals aiming to deepen their Scrum knowledge.}
